Error: Jet.UnknownArgumentLabel: `ProcessSpec.keep_open` has no parameter labeled `slot`
  --> Tests/UI/process_keep_open_label_unknown.jet:8:48
    |
  8 |     _: process.cmd(["true"]).keep_open(reader, slot: 9)
    |                                                ^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: Pass the handle without a label, then the slot as `at:`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownArgumentLabel
